- Always use TypeScript with strict types, no `any`
- Use Next.js App Router server components by default
- Use `'use client'` only when hooks or browser APIs are needed
- Use Zod for all API route input validation
- Use React Query for all client-side data fetching and mutations
- All AI prompts must live in /lib/prompts.ts — never inline them
- Handle loading, error, and empty states for every component
- Use Tailwind CSS only — no inline styles
- shadcn/ui for all UI primitives (Button, Dialog, Drawer, Select, etc.)
- Prisma for all DB access — never raw SQL
- All API routes return { data, error } shaped responses
- Use next/font for all custom fonts
- Platform colors: Instagram=#E1306C, TikTok=#000000, LinkedIn=#0A66C2, Facebook=#1877F2, Twitter=#1DA1F2
- Status colors: IDEA=#6B7280, PLANNED=#F59E0B, DESIGNING=#8B5CF6, READY=#10B981, PUBLISHED=#06B6D4
